// Ch4 C4-09 "The gangplank" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch04.md). The islet's seaward landing, the far
// side from the shrine door: stone steps down to deep water where the reef drops off. The ferry can't
// cross Haluna's flats, so it calls here. The Brightwater ferry, the Kind Weather, has lain here
// overnight, hired by the Order for the Cantor's crossing (F01).
// Ysolde is already at the foot of the gangplank, alone, a folded appointment under her hand: she
// walked the causeway ahead of them in the dark so as not to walk in the Cantor's procession uninvited.
// She presents herself formally; Toma gives the greeting ("Be level." / "And still."); she says,
// briefly and without warmth, why she kept away from the wake. Rhen jokes (harder when he's
// unsettled); her line is the voice guide's. If ch04_saw_ysolde_ink, his quiet line as she turns, and
// her answer is all the scene gives it. No contractions from Ysolde; no more than four lines in a row.
// Music: ysolde_theme. The chapter flow sets ch04_ysolde_joined and seats her in the party.
title: ch04_gangplank
location: ch04/brightwater_ferry
---
@fade in 1.5
@music ysolde_theme fade=2.0
@camera F01
@sfx gangplank
Ysolde [neutral]: Lady Cantor. Ysolde Ysel. The Conclave has appointed me to teach you Lamptongue on the road. #line:ch04_plank_001
@anim ysolde present_appointment asha
Toma [neutral]: Be level. #line:ch04_plank_002
Ysolde [neutral]: And still. #line:ch04_plank_003
Ysolde [neutral]: I did not present myself at your wake. A wake belongs to the village. #line:ch04_plank_004
Asha [soft_smile]: Thank you. This is Rhen Sallow. My guardian. #line:ch04_plank_005
Rhen [smile]: Guardian, porter, cake-carrier. I also do knots, badly. #line:ch04_plank_006
@wait 1.0
Ysolde [cold]: You are very funny, Master Sallow. I have decided not to notice. #line:ch04_plank_007
@anim ysolde turn_to_gangplank
<<if $ch04_saw_ysolde_ink>>
Rhen [neutral]: You did the shells. #line:ch04_plank_008
Ysolde [neutral]: I am the Lady Cantor's tutor in Lamptongue. #line:ch04_plank_009
<<endif>>
@mark ysolde gangplank_top walk
@wait 1.0
@camera release
===
